<title>PORTUGAL: Cimpor selloff price 3,170 escudos.</title>
<headline>Cimpor selloff price 3,170 escudos.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation price of Portuguese cement group Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal is 3,170 escudos per share, a Cimpor source told Reuters at a special session of Lisbon bourse to announce details of the sale.</p>
<p>The government is selling a 45 percent stake in Cimpor.</p>
<p>The government is floating off the stake partly through book building and partly through a public offer to sell (OPV).</p>
<p>The price of the OPV is either that of the direct sale or a recent average of the share price plus five percent, whichever is lower.</p>
<p>Cimpor closed on Lisbon bourse on Monday at 3,278 escudos.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
